    "coverAlt": "2020 夏季號封面",
    "body": "\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\"><p>雖然很辛苦，但我們還是會繼續！<br>是的，我們再次投入地方人文誌的編輯，山海集2020夏季號出刊囉！</p></blockquote>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">本期內容收藏了在地人文故事，有在地竹編達人楊老師、百年中藥舖金保安、竹南小松菸中山168、港墘里日曬麵達人…還有志工祭江演出的花絮報導，每篇文章搭配美麗的照片跟精美插圖。插圖是由創藝工作室的翁老師手繪的，每一個細節都是嘔心瀝血之作。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">為了文化的永續經營，山海集夏季號每本售價49元<br>前100本加贈古厝特色貼紙</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">喜歡山海集的朋友可以在以下地點購買支持喔！<br><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/huansia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">蕃社陳家古厝</a>，<a href=\"https://zh-tw.facebook.com/house35020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">好事HOUSE</a>，<a href=\"https://zh-tw.facebook.com/pages/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1168/107093957500990?fref=mentions&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARDt6AuyXrc3P7aLCG1o0crbK_j1ZvEe7Q2vgDIN-EbGrN7FkECYhHpb9XjKIVp_Ye7rMfYcS_JFH-aDz4pi2f-tRwL4hiesmOx_VWEmRM6tSXijKLvY9dZphGc8UCPRaG8YfVTKNFf5hR-pynZ1R4Uwew66goJBVPqVVo1EDcFzpPkimGHjNxRcdfkjQJjQpwiwj-V-pDZsrenFbD1w8pb9rmxZfc8c7JMsCDZL40QyNC8kCTKjjJf8upWZex_QAwwavV0q0ua5oPWIHfNwbvs672XCFIrZj3JlmEk9iVan7xMnCPKgP2vJLGnqh2cYPFRhgLnBqXwfiC783aZ2g0v6BgIZ&amp;__tn__=K-R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">中山168</a>，<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/bookstorestraces/?fref=mentions&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARDt6AuyXrc3P7aLCG1o0crbK_j1ZvEe7Q2vgDIN-EbGrN7FkECYhHpb9XjKIVp_Ye7rMfYcS_JFH-aDz4pi2f-tRwL4hiesmOx_VWEmRM6tSXijKLvY9dZphGc8UCPRaG8YfVTKNFf5hR-pynZ1R4Uwew66goJBVPqVVo1EDcFzpPkimGHjNxRcdfkjQJjQpwiwj-V-pDZsrenFbD1w8pb9rmxZfc8c7JMsCDZL40QyNC8kCTKjjJf8upWZex_QAwwavV0q0ua5oPWIHfNwbvs672XCFIrZj3JlmEk9iVan7xMnCPKgP2vJLGnqh2cYPFRhgLnBqXwfiC783aZ2g0v6BgIZ&amp;__tn__=K-R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">起點書房 Beginning Bookstore</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">在蕃社陳家古厝8/15, 8/16兩天現場銷售前50本加贈手炒麵茶一包</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">邀請大家支持在地文化創作，讓文化永續經營！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">也歡迎在地企業贊助文化事業！</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-